==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (400%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**9 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Belial (Enemy)|Belials]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Seeing as this stage is dominated by Red peons, it is advised to bring some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]]. Otherwise, just bring ranged units to defeat Belial and Happy 100.

